{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30603","headline":"风不鸣条 · 黄颇","name":"风不鸣条","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"五纬起祥飙，无声瑞圣朝。\n稍开含露蘂，才转惹烟条。\n密叶应潜变，低枝几暗摇。\n林间莺欲啭，花下蝶微飘。\n初满沿堤草，因生逐水苗。\n太平无一事，天外奏虞韶。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"黄颇","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30603.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30603","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}